STAAD PLANE
* V1. Two-story frame, linear static
* Exported by Frame2D Studio. Units kN, m. Sections are prismatic (AX, IZ): no shear deformation.
* Load case 1 = all loads (constant + variable at load factor 1).
START JOB INFORMATION
ENGINEER DATE 2026-11-24
END JOB INFORMATION
INPUT WIDTH 79
UNIT METER KN
JOINT COORDINATES
1 0 0 0;
2 6 0 0;
3 0 3.5 0;
4 6 3.5 0;
5 0 7 0;
6 6 7 0;
MEMBER INCIDENCES
1 1 3;
2 2 4;
3 3 5;
4 4 6;
5 3 4;
6 5 6;
DEFINE MATERIAL START
ISOTROPIC MAT1
E 2.000000E8
POISSON 0.3
DENSITY 76.982202
ALPHA 1.2E-5
END DEFINE MATERIAL
MEMBER PROPERTY
1 TO 4 PRIS AX 0.01709674 IZ 0.00041581519
5 6 PRIS AX 0.009483852 IZ 0.00033298514
CONSTANTS
MATERIAL MAT1 MEMB 1 TO 6
SUPPORTS
1 FIXED
2 FIXED
LOAD 1 LOADTYPE None TITLE ALL LOADS
JOINT LOAD
3 FX 25
5 FX 50
MEMBER LOAD
5 UNI GY -30
6 UNI GY -30
PERFORM ANALYSIS PRINT STATICS CHECK
PRINT JOINT DISPLACEMENTS ALL
PRINT SUPPORT REACTION ALL
PRINT MEMBER FORCES ALL
FINISH
